                    // `m(&pr)` hands the SAME proc through: `b.equal?(pr)` is
                    // true in ruby and a lambda stays a lambda. Rebuilding one
                    // out of the block lost both. pending_srcproc is what
                    // coerce_to_block recorded on the way in.
                    (if map_has pending_srcproc "v" then VProc (map_get pending_srcproc "v")
                     else
