// called on a frozen Class and the ones that raised FrozenError are here.
// Three do NOT: a bare `private` (the visibility MODE, which changes nothing
// yet), `new`/`allocate`, and `dup`/`clone`/subclassing -- a frozen class is
// still a perfectly good class to make things from.
// which statements in a class body actually CHANGE the class?
